<text top="326" left="107" width="703" height="16" font="1">The regularity hope is that viscous smoothing always keeps pace with the sharpening produced</text>
<text top="348" left="108" width="702" height="16" font="1">by nonlinear transport. In three dimensions, vortex stretching gives the nonlinear motion a</text>
<text top="370" left="108" width="199" height="16" font="1">route to sharpen the flow.</text>
